# Theme specification

This document defines the required shape of all Daemon-Core themes.

## Purpose

Themes must provide a consistent visual contract across the desktop shell.

## Theme structure

```text
themes/
├── daemon-dark/
│   ├── theme.json
│   ├── wallpapers/
│   ├── icons/
│   ├── fonts/
│   └── sounds/
├── daemon-light/
└── ...
```

## Required theme file

Each valid theme must provide:

```text
theme.json
```

## Manifest example

```json
{
  "name": "Daemon Dark",
  "id": "daemon-dark",
  "version": "1.0.0",
  "author": "Daemon-Core Team",
  "description": "Default dark theme",
  "colors": {},
  "spacing": {},
  "radius": {},
  "typography": {},
  "animations": {},
  "effects": {},
  "icons": {},
  "wallpaper": {}
}
```

## Required fields

A theme manifest must contain at least:

- `name`
- `id`
- `version`
- `colors`
- `spacing`
- `radius`
- `typography`
- `animations`
- `effects`
- `icons`
- `wallpaper`

## Token categories

### Colors

```json
{
  "primary": "#7c3aed",
  "secondary": "#9333ea",
  "background": "#0f172a",
  "surface": "#1e293b",
  "surfaceAlt": "#334155",
  "text": "#ffffff",
  "textSecondary": "#cbd5e1",
  "success": "#22c55e",
  "warning": "#f59e0b",
  "error": "#ef4444",
  "border": "#475569"
}
```

### Spacing

```json
{
  "xs": 4,
  "sm": 8,
  "md": 16,
  "lg": 24,
  "xl": 32,
  "xxl": 48
}
```

### Radius

```json
{
  "xs": 4,
  "sm": 8,
  "md": 12,
  "lg": 20,
