### Typography

```json
{
  "family": "Inter",
  "sizes": {
    "caption": 12,
    "body": 14,
    "subtitle": 18,
    "title": 24,
    "heading": 32,
    "display": 48
  }
}
```

## Theme loading rules

The active theme must be validated before activation. Validation must check:

- valid JSON
- required fields
- valid file references
- version presence
- compatibility with the renderer

## Theme fallback rules

If a selected theme fails validation, the system must fall back to:

1. the previous valid theme
2. the default theme
3. internal fallback values

## Design rules

- No component may define fixed colors.
- No component may contain hardcoded spacing values.
- No component may define font size directly.
- Theme values must be accessed through `ThemeService`.



